rule c2: at /Od C2 gives a block's locals their frame slots in the order the front end lists them, which is the name hash's 16 buckets upwards: value 1, width 2, count 5, total 7, index 12, height 13
cl /Od
frame= ?f@@YAHXZ
  _count$ = -12
  _total$ = -16
  _index$ = -20
  _value$ = -4
  _width$ = -8
  _height$ = -24
